  "title": "Stuffed Poblano Peppers",
  "description": "Seasoned ground beef and Cheddar and Monterey Jack cheeses make a fabulous filling for these charred and stuffed poblano peppers.",
  "authors": [
    "Laura Trowbridge"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-07-12T20:35:46-04:00",
